1
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,700
=The Road to Splendor=

2
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:34,760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

3
00:01:35,193 --> 00:01:37,373
=Episode 16=

4
00:01:40,207 --> 00:01:41,327
This bamboo scroll

5
00:01:41,767 --> 00:01:43,287
is a farewell letter I restored,

6
00:01:43,448 --> 00:01:45,808
written by a young soldier
to his mother.

7
00:01:47,327 --> 00:01:49,407
"The beacon fires of the border
have not yet died down.

8
00:01:49,927 --> 00:01:51,888
My father and brother
have all fallen on the battlefield.

9
00:01:52,368 --> 00:01:53,648
I fear I too

10
00:01:53,648 --> 00:01:54,847
will follow them.

11
00:01:55,567 --> 00:01:56,567
Mother, do not grieve.

12
00:01:57,567 --> 00:01:58,448
My spirit

13
00:01:59,088 --> 00:02:00,407
will forever guard this land.

14
00:02:01,168 --> 00:02:03,088
It will become the winds
along the border,

15
00:02:03,287 --> 00:02:04,127
year after year,

16
00:02:04,287 --> 00:02:05,648
by your side."

17
00:02:08,768 --> 00:02:09,968
Their experiences,

18
00:02:10,607 --> 00:02:11,648
and even their lives,

19
00:02:12,808 --> 00:02:14,447
will be buried by time.

20
00:02:15,847 --> 00:02:17,968
But future generations
will remember them

21
00:02:17,968 --> 00:02:18,968
through these words.

22
00:02:20,127 --> 00:02:20,847
Future generations

23
00:02:21,007 --> 00:02:21,968
seeing us today

24
00:02:22,328 --> 00:02:23,048
is the same as

25
00:02:23,208 --> 00:02:23,928
us today

26
00:02:24,248 --> 00:02:25,127
seeing the ancients.

27
00:02:25,567 --> 00:02:26,727
That is the meaning

28
00:02:27,248 --> 00:02:28,687
of writing and recording.

29
00:02:30,928 --> 00:02:33,007
The value of written words...

30
00:02:33,488 --> 00:02:34,528
If that's the case...

31
00:02:34,528 --> 00:02:35,847
doesn't depend on who writes them...

32
00:02:35,928 --> 00:02:38,208
even I can't claim
to be a true lover of books.

33
00:02:42,208 --> 00:02:42,928
Young Master.

34
00:02:43,727 --> 00:02:44,528
It's late.

35
00:02:45,447 --> 00:02:47,727
The Book of Songs
speaks of virtue in a gentle maiden.

36
00:02:48,368 --> 00:02:50,607
The Songs of Chu express deep feelings
through fragrant plants.

37
00:02:52,768 --> 00:02:54,768
Even Ananda in the Surangama Sutra

38
00:02:55,808 --> 00:02:57,928
could not escape the snare
of the maiden Matangi.

39
00:02:58,648 --> 00:03:00,127
It seems the snare of love is deep,

40
00:03:02,048 --> 00:03:03,727
inescapable for sage or mortal alike.

41
00:03:04,808 --> 00:03:05,607
But tell me,

42
00:03:06,167 --> 00:03:07,167
why would a man

43
00:03:08,808 --> 00:03:10,928
be drawn to a woman?

44
00:03:11,928 --> 00:03:12,928
Perhaps

45
00:03:13,847 --> 00:03:14,928
because she is beautiful?

46
00:03:18,648 --> 00:03:20,687
Are there not plenty of beautiful women
in this world?

47
00:03:23,007 --> 00:03:23,808
Then

48
00:03:24,768 --> 00:03:26,488
is it her gentle nature?

49
00:03:26,488 --> 00:03:28,328
Which maid in the household
isn't gentle?

50
00:03:29,687 --> 00:03:30,528
Because she is well-read?

51
00:03:32,328 --> 00:03:34,607
All the noble ladies I have known

52
00:03:35,048 --> 00:03:36,528
have been well-versed in the classics.

53
00:03:37,567 --> 00:03:38,447
But none of these

54
00:03:40,648 --> 00:03:41,928
can truly be called love.

55
00:03:43,248 --> 00:03:44,167
Could it be

56
00:03:45,928 --> 00:03:47,048
that she once saved you?

57
00:03:51,887 --> 00:03:53,167
If it were only to show gratitude,

58
00:03:54,488 --> 00:03:56,048
a thousand pieces of gold would suffice.

59
00:03:56,808 --> 00:03:57,928
It is because she is

60
00:03:58,847 --> 00:03:59,928
one of a kind.

61
00:04:01,048 --> 00:04:02,488
When calamity struck Huaying,

62
00:04:04,007 --> 00:04:05,528
she should have withered.

63
00:04:10,127 --> 00:04:10,968
Once,

64
00:04:13,727 --> 00:04:14,968
I loved the narcissus,

65
00:04:15,447 --> 00:04:16,487
not the magnolia.

66
00:04:17,607 --> 00:04:19,568
But now, the magnolia
has wandered to the Gobi,

67
00:04:20,847 --> 00:04:22,448
and grows more like a poplar.

68
00:04:23,328 --> 00:04:24,367
The fiercer the wind,

69
00:04:25,128 --> 00:04:26,128
the stronger it stands.

70
00:04:26,888 --> 00:04:27,768
And the narcissus?

71
00:04:29,088 --> 00:04:30,847
It got its wish
and entered the greenhouse,

72
00:04:31,927 --> 00:04:33,528
yet grows more like a reed,

73
00:04:34,128 --> 00:04:35,407
lost among the masses.

74
00:04:36,568 --> 00:04:37,208
Tell me.

75
00:04:39,568 --> 00:04:40,968
Did I choose wrong?

76
00:04:49,730 --> 00:04:51,883
(Zhao Residence)

77
00:04:56,448 --> 00:04:57,727
Please inform the Ninth Young Lady

78
00:04:58,487 --> 00:04:59,968
that regarding the old matters
in Huaying,

79
00:05:00,407 --> 00:05:01,047
today

80
00:05:01,607 --> 00:05:03,088
I have come to give her an explanation.

81
00:05:05,568 --> 00:05:07,088
Back then, I was arrogant and proud.

82
00:05:07,807 --> 00:05:09,607
I wronged you.

83
00:05:10,208 --> 00:05:11,128
All these years,

84
00:05:12,047 --> 00:05:13,328
whenever I think of it,

85
00:05:13,487 --> 00:05:14,648
my conscience has troubled me.

86
00:05:15,968 --> 00:05:17,807
Is it not too late, Mr. Yu,

87
00:05:19,328 --> 00:05:20,688
to be saying this now?

88
00:05:22,328 --> 00:05:23,607
Indeed, it is too late.

89
00:05:24,367 --> 00:05:25,688
But I came today

90
00:05:27,128 --> 00:05:28,847
precisely to put the past

91
00:05:29,727 --> 00:05:30,768
to rest.

92
00:05:44,847 --> 00:05:47,047
I have already signed
a written confession for you.

93
00:05:47,448 --> 00:05:48,888
It clears your name.

94
00:06:04,888 --> 00:06:06,088
Are you so confident

95
00:06:06,807 --> 00:06:08,328
that even with that confession,

96
00:06:10,088 --> 00:06:11,607
I cannot bring you down?

97
00:06:14,768 --> 00:06:15,968
If you insist on doing this,

98
00:06:17,328 --> 00:06:18,607
I have nothing to say.

99
00:06:19,448 --> 00:06:20,247
It's just that

100
00:06:21,568 --> 00:06:23,328
more than empty fame,

101
00:06:25,008 --> 00:06:26,247
what I truly value

102
00:06:26,727 --> 00:06:28,167
is not making an enemy of you.

103
00:06:57,607 --> 00:06:58,688
(Declarant)

104
00:06:58,768 --> 00:06:59,568
(Yu Jingxiu)

105
00:07:00,247 --> 00:07:02,208
(intended to break the engagement
with Fu Tingyun)

106
00:07:02,210 --> 00:07:03,083
(and framed her for infidelity.)

107
00:07:03,088 --> 00:07:05,008
(Yu Jingxiu, Secret Letter)
(He gave Zuo a wicked scheme,)

108
00:07:05,607 --> 00:07:06,208
(stating)

109
00:07:06,607 --> 00:07:08,088
(if her brother Zuo Junjie)

110
00:07:08,167 --> 00:07:09,607
(Written Confession)
(falsely accused Fu of lost virtue)

111
00:07:10,208 --> 00:07:11,208
(and forced the engagement to end,)

112
00:07:12,008 --> 00:07:14,008
(he'd secure her brother
a future in office.)

113
00:07:15,167 --> 00:07:16,287
(Lest there be no proof later,)

114
00:07:17,088 --> 00:07:18,487
(Declarant: Yu Jingxiu)
(this confession is thus made.)

115
00:07:19,927 --> 00:07:20,847
(Yu Jingxiu)

116
00:07:32,487 --> 00:07:33,688
Is this over just like that?

117
00:07:34,927 --> 00:07:35,528
Miss Xie.

118
00:07:37,328 --> 00:07:38,407
This dress

119
00:07:38,927 --> 00:07:40,648
must have been paid for by that Yu.

120
00:07:40,968 --> 00:07:42,568
Last time you bandaged his wound,

121
00:07:42,568 --> 00:07:43,287
yours got torn.

122
00:07:43,528 --> 00:07:44,768
Look at the pattern and style.

123
00:07:44,768 --> 00:07:45,568
He bought an exact match.

124
00:07:46,807 --> 00:07:47,727
And he left this too.

125
00:07:52,648 --> 00:07:54,688
(The eastern chamber's swing
sways high in the wind.)

126
00:07:55,128 --> 00:07:57,287
(Summer's end,
yet joy still feels too brief.)

127
00:07:57,321 --> 00:07:59,182
(The east chamber)

128
00:08:00,688 --> 00:08:02,247
A pedantic scholar's trick.

129
00:08:04,208 --> 00:08:04,888
Young Master.

130
00:08:05,167 --> 00:08:06,128
The Ninth Young Lady

131
00:08:06,328 --> 00:08:07,487
sent the things back.

132
00:08:12,161 --> 00:08:12,627
(Zhao Residence)

133
00:08:12,648 --> 00:08:13,167
Young Master.

134
00:08:20,487 --> 00:08:21,287
Mr. Yu.

135
00:08:21,607 --> 00:08:22,807
My young lady said

136
00:08:23,247 --> 00:08:24,328
she will not see you again.

137
00:08:24,648 --> 00:08:25,648
Please go back.

138
00:08:26,768 --> 00:08:28,727
What if I insist on opening this door?

139
00:08:34,247 --> 00:08:35,127
Mr. Zhao, you're back.

140
00:08:41,887 --> 00:08:43,928
(She was born a lady of a noble house.)

141
00:08:44,688 --> 00:08:46,328
(Now she wears rough clothes
and eats plain food.)

142
00:08:47,007 --> 00:08:47,767
(Why)

143
00:08:48,847 --> 00:08:50,288
(would you let a jewel like her
be buried in the dust?)

144
00:08:54,767 --> 00:08:55,527
You're back.

145
00:09:12,007 --> 00:09:12,968
Suppose...

146
00:09:15,568 --> 00:09:16,968
Just suppose.

147
00:09:19,527 --> 00:09:21,247
If Fan and Zuo Junjie

148
00:09:22,408 --> 00:09:24,527
hadn't interfered back in Huaying,

149
00:09:25,808 --> 00:09:27,647
with his talent and virtue,

150
00:09:28,088 --> 00:09:29,367
and you in the prime of your youth,

151
00:09:29,847 --> 00:09:31,808
might you have been drawn to each other?

152
00:09:33,527 --> 00:09:35,007
Would you have been a perfect match?

153
00:09:40,168 --> 00:09:41,328
Why would you think that?

154
00:09:45,568 --> 00:09:47,088
He signed the written confession.

155
00:09:49,048 --> 00:09:50,367
That counts as seeing the error
of his ways.

156
00:09:54,727 --> 00:09:56,487
I don't think he feels guilty at all.

157
00:09:58,808 --> 00:10:00,448
Then what trick do you think
he's playing?

158
00:10:03,127 --> 00:10:03,928
Probably

159
00:10:06,247 --> 00:10:07,568
retreating in order to advance.

160
00:10:09,127 --> 00:10:10,527
Who knows what he'll do next?

161
00:10:11,168 --> 00:10:11,968
In any case,

162
00:10:12,168 --> 00:10:13,367
we need to stay on guard.

163
00:10:55,408 --> 00:10:56,048
Look.

164
00:10:58,048 --> 00:10:59,408
That's the Big Dipper.

165
00:11:00,928 --> 00:11:03,808
See how those seven stars together

166
00:11:03,887 --> 00:11:05,208
really do look like a ladle.

167
00:11:09,408 --> 00:11:10,847
The ancients called it

168
00:11:11,127 --> 00:11:12,727
Xuanji Yuheng.

169
00:11:14,127 --> 00:11:15,408
When the handle points east,

170
00:11:15,767 --> 00:11:17,328
spring has come.

171
00:11:18,448 --> 00:11:19,767
When the handle points west,

172
00:11:20,007 --> 00:11:21,527
autumn arrives.

173
00:11:35,408 --> 00:11:37,088
Tonight's breeze

174
00:11:37,808 --> 00:11:38,808
feels nice.

175
00:11:45,968 --> 00:11:46,887
Very cool.

176
00:11:48,356 --> 00:11:55,170
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye
will fill my eyes with tears♪

177
00:11:56,383 --> 00:12:02,983
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

178
00:12:03,607 --> 00:12:07,161
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

179
00:12:07,547 --> 00:12:11,590
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

180
00:12:12,083 --> 00:12:17,423
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

181
00:12:17,568 --> 00:12:18,288
(Advisory Hall)
My Lords,

182
00:12:18,808 --> 00:12:19,568
Ganlin Town

183
00:12:19,647 --> 00:12:21,887
has a tradition
of the Yellow River Lantern Formation.

184
00:12:22,328 --> 00:12:23,288
As the season approaches,

185
00:12:23,367 --> 00:12:24,688
we should use this grand event

186
00:12:25,048 --> 00:12:26,487
to boost the morale
of both soldiers and civilians.

187
00:12:27,688 --> 00:12:28,487
By custom,

188
00:12:29,048 --> 00:12:30,007
the winner of the lantern formation

189
00:12:30,127 --> 00:12:31,247
may ascend the city wall

190
00:12:31,328 --> 00:12:32,448
to light the lanterns and offer prayers.

191
00:12:33,847 --> 00:12:36,007
Now that the women's hall is thriving,

192
00:12:36,487 --> 00:12:37,448
we might bend the rules

193
00:12:37,887 --> 00:12:38,607
and select

194
00:12:39,007 --> 00:12:40,727
a virtuous and talented woman.

195
00:12:41,328 --> 00:12:43,247
Young Lord Yu, you've seen a lot.

196
00:12:43,247 --> 00:12:44,007
May I ask

197
00:12:44,328 --> 00:12:45,647
what you would suggest?

198
00:12:46,208 --> 00:12:47,007
In my view,

199
00:12:47,968 --> 00:12:49,847
Ms. Xie would be most suitable.

200
00:12:52,048 --> 00:12:53,007
However,

201
00:12:53,007 --> 00:12:54,127
this lantern festival

202
00:12:54,127 --> 00:12:55,527
requires a considerable sum.

203
00:12:55,688 --> 00:12:57,688
I fear it may be beyond our means.

204
00:12:58,288 --> 00:12:59,127
I...

205
00:12:59,647 --> 00:13:00,607
Commander Wang.

206
00:13:01,168 --> 00:13:02,847
It's only a lantern festival.

207
00:13:02,928 --> 00:13:04,288
How much could it possibly cost?

208
00:13:05,007 --> 00:13:06,408
Indeed, Commander Wang.

209
00:13:06,928 --> 00:13:08,168
Sharing joy with the people

210
00:13:08,168 --> 00:13:09,247
is also good governance.

211
00:13:09,487 --> 00:13:10,448
Don't you agree?

212
00:13:17,448 --> 00:13:18,007
I take my leave.

213
00:13:18,007 --> 00:13:18,688
I take my leave.

214
00:13:22,288 --> 00:13:23,688
Commander Wang, please stay.

215
00:13:26,288 --> 00:13:27,607
If I may be so bold,

216
00:13:28,487 --> 00:13:29,647
the match between a scholar
and a lady

217
00:13:30,007 --> 00:13:32,847
has always been beloved by the people.

218
00:13:33,168 --> 00:13:35,568
So this time, we must ensure Ms. Xie

219
00:13:36,007 --> 00:13:37,328
and the winner of the lantern formation

220
00:13:37,328 --> 00:13:38,568
ascend the stage together.

221
00:13:38,847 --> 00:13:41,007
This will surely give Ganlin Town

222
00:13:41,168 --> 00:13:42,408
a story for the ages.

223
00:13:48,328 --> 00:13:50,208
I heard you proposed to Commander Wang

224
00:13:50,208 --> 00:13:52,168
that a market be set up
during the Lantern Festival,

225
00:13:53,007 --> 00:13:54,408
with booth rentals

226
00:13:54,408 --> 00:13:55,767
covering the costs.

227
00:13:57,247 --> 00:13:59,007
If you pull this off,

228
00:13:59,127 --> 00:14:00,328
year after year,

229
00:14:00,607 --> 00:14:02,847
this tradition can carry on.

230
00:14:03,367 --> 00:14:04,328
Gradually,

231
00:14:04,527 --> 00:14:06,727
Ganlin Town
will become a commercial hub.

232
00:14:07,328 --> 00:14:08,607
That would be real political merit

233
00:14:08,808 --> 00:14:09,727
for Commander Wang,

234
00:14:10,168 --> 00:14:11,847
and for you as well.

235
00:14:13,127 --> 00:14:15,688
Who says you can only fight fire
with fire in the military?

236
00:14:17,847 --> 00:14:18,688
Mr. Zhao,

237
00:14:19,767 --> 00:14:21,367
with that flexibility,

238
00:14:21,727 --> 00:14:23,168
you're sure to build a bright future.

239
00:14:25,288 --> 00:14:26,088
When the time comes,

240
00:14:26,328 --> 00:14:28,127
I will ascend the tower to cheer you on.

241
00:14:28,847 --> 00:14:29,607
Do you

242
00:14:30,328 --> 00:14:31,767
know what ascending the tower entails?

243
00:14:32,568 --> 00:14:33,288
I do.

244
00:14:33,527 --> 00:14:34,408
I hear

245
00:14:34,408 --> 00:14:35,647
they'll have me hold the staff
and light the lantern.

246
00:14:35,887 --> 00:14:36,727
Then...

247
00:14:42,808 --> 00:14:43,568
Do you want to go?

248
00:14:43,767 --> 00:14:45,168
They say this year,

249
00:14:45,168 --> 00:14:46,247
as a special exception for me,

250
00:14:46,928 --> 00:14:48,727
it's meant
to encourage women's education.

251
00:14:48,928 --> 00:14:50,088
How could I refuse?

252
00:15:00,288 --> 00:15:01,048
Mr. Zhao,

253
00:15:01,048 --> 00:15:02,247
aren't you going to stop her?

254
00:15:02,607 --> 00:15:04,048
Yu Jingxiu is determined to win.

255
00:15:04,208 --> 00:15:05,448
If he lights the lantern with her

256
00:15:05,448 --> 00:15:06,767
in front of everyone,

257
00:15:06,767 --> 00:15:07,127
then...

258
00:15:07,568 --> 00:15:08,688
He's determined to win.

259
00:15:08,808 --> 00:15:09,568
Does that mean he will?

260
00:15:11,779 --> 00:15:13,999
(Chiyu Post Station)

261
00:15:14,048 --> 00:15:15,568
Young Master, I don't recall you
putting this much effort in,

262
00:15:16,007 --> 00:15:17,408
even back in the imperial exams.

263
00:15:17,647 --> 00:15:19,727
The imperial exams,
of course, I had to fight for.

264
00:15:20,928 --> 00:15:21,887
But this lantern formation,

265
00:15:23,127 --> 00:15:24,607
I cannot fall behind in that either.

266
00:15:43,408 --> 00:15:44,127
Mr. Zhao.

267
00:15:45,847 --> 00:15:47,007
Go. Hurry up!

268
00:15:47,408 --> 00:15:48,048
Let's go.

269
00:15:52,847 --> 00:15:53,688
What are you thinking about?

270
00:15:57,727 --> 00:15:58,767
In our future,

271
00:16:02,968 --> 00:16:04,127
will we be married?

272
00:16:11,647 --> 00:16:12,928
Some couples in this world

273
00:16:14,568 --> 00:16:15,647
share a bed but not a heart,

274
00:16:17,208 --> 00:16:18,487
yet play the part in public.

275
00:16:20,727 --> 00:16:22,007
Some treat each other with respect,

276
00:16:23,527 --> 00:16:24,767
yet remain worlds apart.

277
00:16:27,048 --> 00:16:28,208
Some weather the storms together,

278
00:16:30,168 --> 00:16:31,448
yet still lose to time.

279
00:16:34,527 --> 00:16:35,808
Some have run their course,

280
00:16:39,968 --> 00:16:41,247
yet are bound together all the same.

281
00:16:45,847 --> 00:16:46,527
Tingyun.

282
00:16:48,007 --> 00:16:48,968
I want to ask you something.

283
00:16:51,288 --> 00:16:52,647
When we're married someday...

284
00:16:52,723 --> 00:16:56,330
♪Let this fleeting world carry me
through a life adrift♪

285
00:16:56,367 --> 00:16:57,808
what kind of couple
do you hope we'll be?

286
00:16:58,903 --> 00:17:03,760
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

287
00:17:05,350 --> 00:17:08,057
♪Though each move is forced upon me♪

288
00:17:08,130 --> 00:17:12,530
♪May it buy the world
one moment's peace from the storm♪

289
00:17:12,837 --> 00:17:17,964
♪I crave no clarity
from outside my soul♪

290
00:17:19,323 --> 00:17:23,480
♪I crave no clarity♪

291
00:17:24,518 --> 00:17:26,879
♪from outside my soul♪

292
00:17:38,567 --> 00:17:39,487
Ladies and gentlemen, please.

293
00:17:39,888 --> 00:17:41,648
This year's
Yellow River Lantern Formation

294
00:17:41,888 --> 00:17:42,848
is set according to the Eight Trigrams,

295
00:17:42,928 --> 00:17:44,047
with a gate for each direction.

296
00:17:44,448 --> 00:17:45,168
Enter through the Life Gate,

297
00:17:45,247 --> 00:17:46,087
exit through the Rest Gate.

298
00:17:46,327 --> 00:17:47,527
If you mistakenly
step into the Death Gate,

299
00:17:47,648 --> 00:17:48,888
the formation will shift.

300
00:17:49,767 --> 00:17:50,888
Whoever emerges first

301
00:17:51,208 --> 00:17:52,448
will be the victor.

302
00:17:52,767 --> 00:17:53,688
Whether you can break it

303
00:17:54,047 --> 00:17:55,527
depends on your skill.

304
00:17:56,327 --> 00:17:57,567
With such a grand spectacle,

305
00:17:57,807 --> 00:17:58,807
Young Lord Yu,

306
00:17:59,527 --> 00:18:00,608
would you care to enter

307
00:18:00,727 --> 00:18:01,928
and show us what you've got?

308
00:18:02,247 --> 00:18:04,888
Young Lord Yu is a civil official
from the capital.

309
00:18:05,087 --> 00:18:06,408
He is of high status.

310
00:18:06,688 --> 00:18:08,888
Down there are all our soldiers.

311
00:18:08,888 --> 00:18:09,608
They are rough and reckless.

312
00:18:09,608 --> 00:18:10,888
If anything goes wrong,

313
00:18:10,888 --> 00:18:12,608
I cannot bear the responsibility.

314
00:18:12,727 --> 00:18:13,487
Commander Wang,

315
00:18:15,287 --> 00:18:16,848
this formation is based
on the Eight Trigrams.

316
00:18:16,848 --> 00:18:18,247
Though I am a civil official,

317
00:18:18,247 --> 00:18:19,688
I have studied
the Book of Changes since childhood.

318
00:18:19,848 --> 00:18:21,727
I am no stranger
to the Eight Trigrams formation.

319
00:18:22,448 --> 00:18:24,767
Since you're so inclined,

320
00:18:25,087 --> 00:18:26,608
I will not stand in your way.

321
00:19:47,727 --> 00:19:48,767
Something is definitely off.

322
00:19:49,688 --> 00:19:50,648
Something is wrong.

323
00:19:51,168 --> 00:19:51,928
Look at him.

324
00:19:52,047 --> 00:19:53,527
He doesn't even need
to check directions.

325
00:19:53,688 --> 00:19:54,848
He walks through these crossroads

326
00:19:54,848 --> 00:19:56,727
like he's strolling in his own backyard.

327
00:19:56,928 --> 00:19:57,648
Could it be

328
00:19:57,727 --> 00:19:58,767
he secretly studied the formation

329
00:19:59,208 --> 00:20:00,368
and knows all the tricks?

330
00:20:02,767 --> 00:20:03,767
(Go into the formation)

331
00:20:03,767 --> 00:20:05,168
(to set up some traps)

332
00:20:05,408 --> 00:20:07,327
(And place some of our own men inside.)

333
00:20:07,327 --> 00:20:08,487
(No matter what,)

334
00:20:08,688 --> 00:20:09,567
(make sure)

335
00:20:09,567 --> 00:20:11,128
(Young Master Yu)

336
00:20:11,247 --> 00:20:12,727
(emerges first.)

337
00:20:13,448 --> 00:20:14,168
That's not fair.

338
00:20:14,487 --> 00:20:15,608
Having a powerful father

339
00:20:15,608 --> 00:20:17,007
means he can ignore the rules?

340
00:20:17,007 --> 00:20:17,888
He must be beaten.

341
00:20:17,888 --> 00:20:19,168
This can't go on.

342
00:20:20,648 --> 00:20:21,727
The Rest Gate is hard to find.

343
00:20:21,727 --> 00:20:22,688
Do you know where the Death Gate is?

344
00:20:22,688 --> 00:20:23,527
Success is uncertain,

345
00:20:23,807 --> 00:20:25,087
but I've had plenty of

346
00:20:25,287 --> 00:20:26,007
experience with failure.

347
00:20:26,007 --> 00:20:26,287
Let's go.

348
00:20:30,567 --> 00:20:32,368
I thought he had some skill.

349
00:20:32,368 --> 00:20:33,527
But now it seems

350
00:20:34,087 --> 00:20:35,087
he's nothing special.

351
00:20:36,527 --> 00:20:37,688
(We hope you will go easy on us)

352
00:20:37,767 --> 00:20:39,648
(Lantern Formation)
(in the performance review.)

353
00:20:48,208 --> 00:20:48,727
Mr. Zhao.

354
00:20:48,727 --> 00:20:49,368
(Death)
Death Gate.

355
00:21:00,743 --> 00:21:02,003
(Death)

356
00:21:12,097 --> 00:21:13,417
(Death)

357
00:21:41,007 --> 00:21:42,688
Too easy!

358
00:21:43,527 --> 00:21:44,767
Is it that your garrison

359
00:21:45,007 --> 00:21:46,408
has been slacking off?

360
00:21:46,608 --> 00:21:48,408
Is this all you've got?

361
00:21:50,648 --> 00:21:51,928
Nonsense!

362
00:21:52,448 --> 00:21:54,487
I deliberately went easy on you.

363
00:21:54,487 --> 00:21:55,968
And now you're putting on airs?

364
00:21:56,168 --> 00:21:56,807
Fine.

365
00:21:57,007 --> 00:21:57,688
Bring it on!

366
00:21:58,047 --> 00:21:58,767
Change the formation!

367
00:22:10,208 --> 00:22:10,888
Mr. Zhao.

368
00:22:11,208 --> 00:22:12,807
Yu Jingxiu is truly stumped.

369
00:22:29,848 --> 00:22:31,047
(When the handle points east,)

370
00:22:31,408 --> 00:22:33,007
(spring has come.)

371
00:22:33,327 --> 00:22:34,688
(When the handle points west,)

372
00:22:34,928 --> 00:22:36,448
(autumn arrives.)

373
00:22:37,567 --> 00:22:38,327
I've got an idea.

374
00:22:41,727 --> 00:22:42,408
Sanniang.

375
00:22:42,807 --> 00:22:43,807
Go and find out

376
00:22:43,807 --> 00:22:44,807
what's really going on.

377
00:22:44,807 --> 00:22:45,487
Alright.

378
00:22:54,047 --> 00:22:55,128
(I don't know much about formations,)

379
00:22:55,448 --> 00:22:56,727
(but I do know a bit
about reading the stars.)

380
00:22:56,968 --> 00:22:57,567
(This central pole)

381
00:22:57,648 --> 00:22:58,688
(is the heart of the formation.)

382
00:22:59,168 --> 00:23:00,688
(According to the ancient design
of the Yellow River Formation,)

383
00:23:00,888 --> 00:23:02,087
(it must symbolize the North Star.)

384
00:23:02,408 --> 00:23:03,047
(At the Autumnal Equinox,)

385
00:23:03,168 --> 00:23:04,087
(the handle points west.)

386
00:23:04,087 --> 00:23:05,688
(So my left is west,
and my right is east.)

387
00:23:05,848 --> 00:23:07,767
(So this formation hides deadly traps.)

388
00:23:08,888 --> 00:23:09,727
(The Nine Stars of the Big Dipper.)

389
00:23:09,888 --> 00:23:10,888
(Seven visible, two hidden.)

390
00:23:11,168 --> 00:23:12,128
(The central pole marks the core.)

391
00:23:12,128 --> 00:23:13,168
(Alkaid points to the Rest Gate.)

392
00:23:13,608 --> 00:23:14,648
(And those two hidden stars)

393
00:23:14,928 --> 00:23:16,247
(are the true way out.)

394
00:23:16,807 --> 00:23:18,688
(The left assistant star aligns
with the Wei constellation.)

395
00:23:19,168 --> 00:23:20,928
(The right assistant aligns
with the Xu constellation.)

396
00:23:21,527 --> 00:23:22,928
(Where their paths cross)

397
00:23:23,888 --> 00:23:24,848
(is the Rest Gate.)

398
00:23:48,247 --> 00:23:49,007
Miss Xie.

399
00:23:50,408 --> 00:23:51,448
Miss Xie, I...

400
00:23:52,128 --> 00:23:53,168
There's something

401
00:23:53,807 --> 00:23:55,128
I've been thinking about,

402
00:23:55,487 --> 00:23:57,247
and I feel I should tell you.

403
00:23:57,727 --> 00:23:59,368
Today, the one
who wins the lantern formation

404
00:24:00,968 --> 00:24:02,448
will be the one to ascend the tower

405
00:24:03,168 --> 00:24:04,608
and light the lantern with you.

406
00:24:10,928 --> 00:24:12,648
So their proposal
to have me light the lantern

407
00:24:13,128 --> 00:24:14,888
was never about promoting
the women's hall.

408
00:24:16,767 --> 00:24:18,448
It was to please Yu Jingxiu.

409
00:24:20,448 --> 00:24:21,648
Does Mr. Zhao know about this?

410
00:24:22,648 --> 00:24:23,608
Mr. Zhao said

411
00:24:24,168 --> 00:24:25,327
he will definitely win.

412
00:24:25,327 --> 00:24:26,287
He told you to wait for him.

413
00:24:56,128 --> 00:24:57,047
Is that Mr. Zhao?

414
00:25:13,168 --> 00:25:14,168
It's Mr. Zhao.

415
00:25:15,608 --> 00:25:16,567
It really is Mr. Zhao.

416
00:25:17,087 --> 00:25:17,888
I announce

417
00:25:17,888 --> 00:25:19,128
the winner is Zhao Ling.

418
00:25:19,128 --> 00:25:19,767
Good!

419
00:25:19,767 --> 00:25:24,208
Good!

420
00:25:51,807 --> 00:25:52,527
Mr. Zhao.

421
00:25:56,807 --> 00:25:57,608
Mr. Zhao.

422
00:26:04,688 --> 00:26:07,047
Good!

423
00:26:07,047 --> 00:26:07,648
How are you feeling?

424
00:26:08,168 --> 00:26:09,208
Are you hurt anywhere?

425
00:26:09,208 --> 00:26:10,047
Are you alright?

426
00:26:37,208 --> 00:26:38,888
I'm just glad you're okay.

427
00:26:44,608 --> 00:26:46,368
Good!

428
00:26:57,047 --> 00:26:58,648
Good!

429
00:27:05,848 --> 00:27:07,807
A match made in heaven.

430
00:27:08,208 --> 00:27:09,128
If only I could

431
00:27:09,128 --> 00:27:11,128
have a man like Mr. Zhao,

432
00:27:11,128 --> 00:27:12,327
how wonderful that would be.

433
00:27:13,247 --> 00:27:14,648
Only Ms. Xie

434
00:27:14,648 --> 00:27:16,408
deserves such a fine man.

435
00:27:16,928 --> 00:27:18,047
A perfect union!

436
00:27:18,047 --> 00:27:19,448
A perfect union!

437
00:27:19,448 --> 00:27:26,007
Good!

438
00:27:32,007 --> 00:27:32,688
Miss Xie.

439
00:28:06,727 --> 00:28:12,297
Good!

440
00:28:12,297 --> 00:28:17,868
Good!

441
00:28:17,868 --> 00:28:23,439
Good!

442
00:28:23,439 --> 00:28:29,007
Good!

443
00:28:52,807 --> 00:28:53,767
What if

444
00:28:54,368 --> 00:28:55,648
you hadn't broken the formation,

445
00:28:56,727 --> 00:28:58,968
and Yu Jingxiu had reached the end
before you?

446
00:29:00,087 --> 00:29:01,688
If I had lit the lantern with him

447
00:29:01,968 --> 00:29:03,168
and enjoyed the view together,

448
00:29:04,807 --> 00:29:06,527
would that have been a tale to tell?

449
00:29:12,247 --> 00:29:13,448
Do you care about me?

450
00:29:16,408 --> 00:29:17,408
I didn't tell you

451
00:29:20,007 --> 00:29:21,567
because
I didn't want to spoil your mood.

452
00:29:21,848 --> 00:29:23,527
For the sake of my whim,

453
00:29:24,247 --> 00:29:25,208
did you just go ahead

454
00:29:25,208 --> 00:29:27,047
and do everything all by yourself?

455
00:29:27,247 --> 00:29:28,767
If you had been badly hurt

456
00:29:28,968 --> 00:29:30,047
while breaking the formation,

457
00:29:30,247 --> 00:29:31,807
do you think I wouldn't feel guilty?

458
00:29:32,247 --> 00:29:33,888
If Yu Jingxiu had used every trick

459
00:29:33,888 --> 00:29:34,767
and won the formation,

460
00:29:35,247 --> 00:29:37,247
and rumors about us started to spread,

461
00:29:38,087 --> 00:29:39,648
do you think I wouldn't be humiliated?

462
00:29:44,567 --> 00:29:45,327
I'm sorry.

463
00:29:51,368 --> 00:29:52,767
I'm the one who should be sorry.

464
00:29:55,368 --> 00:29:58,408
You asked me before
what kind of couple I wanted us to be.

465
00:29:59,608 --> 00:30:00,608
Just now,

466
00:30:00,928 --> 00:30:01,968
I figured it out.

467
00:30:03,567 --> 00:30:05,327
I didn't make myself clear.

468
00:30:07,047 --> 00:30:08,807
I want to pledge my life to you,

469
00:30:10,368 --> 00:30:12,567
not just to find a suitable partner

470
00:30:12,567 --> 00:30:13,567
to walk the road to splendor together.

471
00:30:14,688 --> 00:30:16,448
I also want to find someone
I truly love,

472
00:30:17,208 --> 00:30:18,408
to quietly watch our days bloom.

473
00:30:21,888 --> 00:30:24,128
You've carried my ideals and my dignity.

474
00:30:25,208 --> 00:30:26,128
Yet you have never

475
00:30:26,128 --> 00:30:27,727
asked anything of me.

476
00:30:29,327 --> 00:30:29,968
Mr. Zhao,

477
00:30:30,567 --> 00:30:32,087
I don't just want someone

478
00:30:32,087 --> 00:30:33,327
to run a household with.

479
00:30:35,807 --> 00:30:37,287
I want to cherish you

480
00:30:38,848 --> 00:30:39,648
and love you.

481
00:30:42,087 --> 00:30:42,727
Zhao Ling,

482
00:30:44,608 --> 00:30:46,327
are we in love with each other?

483
00:30:46,375 --> 00:30:51,652
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

484
00:30:58,247 --> 00:30:59,807
(Mr. Zhao, will you marry me?)

485
00:31:02,208 --> 00:31:03,087
(What if)

486
00:31:03,888 --> 00:31:05,688
(we got married here in Ganlin Town?)

487
00:31:08,527 --> 00:31:09,608
Close your eyes.

488
00:31:10,116 --> 00:31:16,869
♪I turn away, afraid
no one will ever come home to me again♪

489
00:31:18,019 --> 00:31:24,413
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

490
00:31:25,239 --> 00:31:28,546
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

491
00:31:29,214 --> 00:31:33,320
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

492
00:31:33,821 --> 00:31:38,968
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

493
00:32:08,128 --> 00:32:10,168
Did I ever tell you to harm Zhao Ling?

494
00:32:10,968 --> 00:32:11,968
It's my fault.

495
00:32:12,767 --> 00:32:13,968
I should not have acted on my own.

496
00:32:15,928 --> 00:32:17,247
Since it's already done,

497
00:32:18,807 --> 00:32:19,727
then why

498
00:32:21,087 --> 00:32:22,807
not make it permanent?

499
00:32:24,888 --> 00:32:26,848
Please enlighten me, Young Lord Yu.

500
00:32:27,807 --> 00:32:29,208
If I want to have her,

501
00:32:31,527 --> 00:32:33,848
what good is it to just wound Zhao Ling?

502
00:32:35,968 --> 00:32:37,727
You need Zhao Ling dead.

503
00:32:39,408 --> 00:32:40,408
Sun Desheng.

504
00:32:40,767 --> 00:32:41,168
Yes.

505
00:32:41,688 --> 00:32:43,408
For capturing six warhorses,

506
00:32:44,327 --> 00:32:45,567
you'll be made a banner commander.

507
00:32:45,888 --> 00:32:46,567
Thank you, Commander.

508
00:32:49,688 --> 00:32:51,168
And finally,

509
00:32:58,007 --> 00:32:59,928
the post of garrison commander

510
00:32:59,928 --> 00:33:01,567
has been reviewed by the Ministry of War

511
00:33:03,648 --> 00:33:05,087
and will still be held by Mo Yi.

512
00:33:13,608 --> 00:33:14,448
Thank you, Commander.

513
00:33:15,608 --> 00:33:17,608
How many times must I say this?

514
00:33:17,767 --> 00:33:19,247
We are not forgetting your merits.

515
00:33:20,007 --> 00:33:21,208
But the court

516
00:33:21,208 --> 00:33:22,888
has its own considerations.

517
00:33:23,408 --> 00:33:24,527
Wait a few more days,

518
00:33:24,527 --> 00:33:25,487
and the rewards will come.

519
00:33:25,767 --> 00:33:26,408
Commander,

520
00:33:27,168 --> 00:33:29,487
you only come once
every five or six years.

521
00:33:29,727 --> 00:33:31,128
You want us to wait?

522
00:33:31,527 --> 00:33:33,007
Are we supposed to wait
five or six years?

523
00:33:35,128 --> 00:33:37,168
You may be low-ranking,
but your temper is anything but.

524
00:33:38,448 --> 00:33:39,688
You new recruits

525
00:33:39,688 --> 00:33:41,047
are all quite capable, aren't you?

526
00:33:41,208 --> 00:33:42,208
If you're so capable,

527
00:33:42,208 --> 00:33:43,648
why are you in such a hurry?

528
00:33:44,128 --> 00:33:45,767
You're not like Lu Dahu.

529
00:33:45,767 --> 00:33:46,888
Not destined for an early grave.

530
00:33:47,688 --> 00:33:48,087
Oh, right.

531
00:33:48,567 --> 00:33:49,608
He did have one

532
00:33:49,608 --> 00:33:51,327
major merit that was never recorded.

533
00:33:52,487 --> 00:33:53,608
So eager for promotion?

534
00:33:54,688 --> 00:33:56,087
Then follow his lead.

535
00:33:56,087 --> 00:33:57,888
Go earn yourself a big merit
and show us.

536
00:33:58,608 --> 00:33:59,287
Enough.

537
00:33:59,688 --> 00:34:00,888
Do you want to hit me?

538
00:34:09,368 --> 00:34:10,928
That deputy battalion commander post
is gone?

539
00:34:11,207 --> 00:34:12,607
All the merits our brothers fought for

540
00:34:12,607 --> 00:34:13,527
with our lives,

541
00:34:14,167 --> 00:34:15,167
now they go to someone else.

542
00:34:15,607 --> 00:34:16,728
It's infuriating.

543
00:34:17,087 --> 00:34:19,288
We owe this all to Commander Wang's
wisdom and integrity.

544
00:34:37,903 --> 00:34:40,723
(Mo Residence)

545
00:34:43,087 --> 00:34:43,928
Brothers,

546
00:34:45,167 --> 00:34:46,288
drink up.

547
00:34:46,288 --> 00:34:47,448
There's plenty of wine.

548
00:34:47,567 --> 00:34:49,328
Cheers!

549
00:34:49,328 --> 00:34:51,248
- Commander Wang.
- (Congratulations, General Mo.)

550
00:34:51,808 --> 00:34:53,527
Congratulations!

551
00:34:53,607 --> 00:34:54,207
Everyone,

552
00:34:55,448 --> 00:34:56,248
today,

553
00:34:56,567 --> 00:34:58,728
my husband
has been restored to his post.

554
00:34:59,487 --> 00:35:00,768
So all you brothers,

555
00:35:00,768 --> 00:35:01,968
eat and drink to your hearts' content.

556
00:35:02,248 --> 00:35:03,888
There's plenty of wine and mutton.

557
00:35:03,888 --> 00:35:04,647
Great!

558
00:35:04,647 --> 00:35:05,408
Look at that.

559
00:35:05,408 --> 00:35:07,567
General Mo is finally
holding his head high.

560
00:35:07,808 --> 00:35:09,167
But what about the Zhao family?

561
00:35:09,167 --> 00:35:10,888
Mr. Zhao was stripped
of his military merits.

562
00:35:11,007 --> 00:35:13,007
Miss Xie must be feeling bad inside.

563
00:35:14,368 --> 00:35:15,888
It's always the same.

564
00:35:15,888 --> 00:35:17,888
Some celebrate while others grieve.

565
00:35:18,127 --> 00:35:20,087
Otherwise, look at Miss Xie.

566
00:35:20,408 --> 00:35:21,408
She, of all people,

567
00:35:21,408 --> 00:35:22,888
knows how to read the room.

568
00:35:23,647 --> 00:35:24,288
Today,

569
00:35:24,328 --> 00:35:25,448
why didn't she show up?

570
00:35:34,527 --> 00:35:35,328
Ninth Young Lady.

571
00:35:38,087 --> 00:35:38,647
Please sit.

572
00:35:40,487 --> 00:35:42,167
Please be brief, Lord Yu.

573
00:35:42,567 --> 00:35:44,007
I have another banquet
to attend shortly.

574
00:35:47,167 --> 00:35:48,527
Company Commander Zhao has been wronged.

575
00:35:49,167 --> 00:35:50,408
I wish to help.

576
00:35:51,047 --> 00:35:52,167
You need not be on guard,
Ninth Young Lady.

577
00:35:53,288 --> 00:35:54,768
Back then, for my own selfish gain,

578
00:35:55,527 --> 00:35:56,768
I ruined your reputation,

579
00:35:57,207 --> 00:35:58,647
and thus altered your fate.

580
00:35:59,127 --> 00:36:00,087
Now, looking back,

581
00:36:00,928 --> 00:36:01,888
I am filled with regret.

582
00:36:02,728 --> 00:36:03,328
I only wish

583
00:36:04,527 --> 00:36:05,408
to make amends.

584
00:36:05,527 --> 00:36:06,127
No need.

585
00:36:08,127 --> 00:36:09,687
Losing the match with the Yu family

586
00:36:10,728 --> 00:36:11,928
was a misfortune back then,

587
00:36:12,408 --> 00:36:14,248
but now I see it as a blessing.

588
00:36:16,567 --> 00:36:19,167
I have decided to marry Mr. Zhao
once we return to the capital.

589
00:36:19,888 --> 00:36:20,527
From now on,

590
00:36:20,928 --> 00:36:23,167
I hope you and I
will go our separate ways.

591
00:36:23,888 --> 00:36:25,248
Do not disturb me again.

592
00:36:26,127 --> 00:36:27,527
Why are you so cold, Ninth Young Lady?

593
00:36:28,928 --> 00:36:29,567
In all my life,

594
00:36:30,728 --> 00:36:32,288
I have never bowed to anyone.

595
00:36:32,288 --> 00:36:32,928
Never bent my knee.

596
00:36:34,368 --> 00:36:35,167
All I ask is

597
00:36:36,728 --> 00:36:37,968
that you turn and look at me.

598
00:36:39,207 --> 00:36:40,248
Hear me out.

599
00:36:40,768 --> 00:36:42,167
Why are you always so unmoved?

600
00:36:43,087 --> 00:36:44,848
How could Zhao Ling
ever understand your talent?

601
00:36:46,968 --> 00:36:48,687
I only want to be your kindred spirit.

602
00:36:51,047 --> 00:36:52,127
Is it too much to ask

603
00:36:52,848 --> 00:36:53,687
that someone understand me?

604
00:36:57,527 --> 00:36:58,687
I was framed.

605
00:36:59,968 --> 00:37:00,968
My reputation was ruined.

606
00:37:02,368 --> 00:37:03,607
I was nearly poisoned

607
00:37:03,607 --> 00:37:04,607
to death in Biyun Nunnery.

608
00:37:05,888 --> 00:37:07,288
You destroyed my future,

609
00:37:08,047 --> 00:37:09,888
yet you think a simple apology

610
00:37:09,888 --> 00:37:10,888
would earn my forgiveness?

611
00:37:11,207 --> 00:37:12,607
And then I would see you again

612
00:37:12,607 --> 00:37:13,968
as an honorable and virtuous man?

613
00:37:15,288 --> 00:37:15,928
Lord Yu,

614
00:37:17,127 --> 00:37:19,127
why does forgiveness
come so cheap for you?

615
00:37:19,928 --> 00:37:21,248
Is it because
you come from a noble family,

616
00:37:21,248 --> 00:37:22,728
born to stand above the rest?

617
00:37:25,248 --> 00:37:26,928
They say a prodigal's return
is worth more than gold.

618
00:37:27,567 --> 00:37:29,768
But if a beggar or a bandit
were to turn over a new leaf,

619
00:37:30,248 --> 00:37:31,888
would it be worth just as much?

620
00:37:33,368 --> 00:37:34,928
So it's not that I'm unforgiving,

621
00:37:35,728 --> 00:37:37,687
clinging to one person's past wrongs.

622
00:37:38,888 --> 00:37:40,047
It is you, Lord Yu,

623
00:37:40,207 --> 00:37:42,167
who has never understood
the heart of the matter.

624
00:37:44,087 --> 00:37:45,728
You were born into privilege.

625
00:37:46,607 --> 00:37:48,448
So what you consider precious,

626
00:37:49,888 --> 00:37:51,647
your affection, your dignity,

627
00:37:52,888 --> 00:37:54,368
you offer them to me as a kindness.

628
00:37:55,007 --> 00:37:55,808
But I do not find

629
00:37:55,808 --> 00:37:57,087
those things precious at all.

630
00:38:07,167 --> 00:38:08,448
Why are you hiding in here?

631
00:38:09,248 --> 00:38:10,007
Come on.

632
00:38:10,448 --> 00:38:11,527
Your colleagues are all here.

633
00:38:12,288 --> 00:38:14,087
Quite a few brothers are already drunk.

634
00:38:16,288 --> 00:38:17,968
I don't deserve

635
00:38:17,968 --> 00:38:19,487
this reinstatement.

636
00:38:20,167 --> 00:38:21,207
I've let Zhao down,

637
00:38:21,207 --> 00:38:22,127
and Miss Xie, too.

638
00:38:22,448 --> 00:38:22,968
And you?

639
00:38:22,968 --> 00:38:24,087
You're out there throwing a big party.

640
00:38:24,087 --> 00:38:25,167
How can I show my face?

641
00:38:26,567 --> 00:38:28,047
You want to be true to your brothers?

642
00:38:28,647 --> 00:38:30,127
Then what about your family?

643
00:38:30,848 --> 00:38:32,087
Three children at home,

644
00:38:32,087 --> 00:38:33,167
three mouths

645
00:38:33,728 --> 00:38:34,647
to feed,

646
00:38:34,647 --> 00:38:36,127
all depending on your pay.

647
00:38:36,288 --> 00:38:36,728
Fine.

648
00:38:37,368 --> 00:38:38,248
If you've got the spine,

649
00:38:38,328 --> 00:38:39,087
go ahead

650
00:38:39,487 --> 00:38:40,808
and tell Commander Wang

651
00:38:40,808 --> 00:38:41,968
to take back your merits,

652
00:38:41,968 --> 00:38:43,127
start all over from scratch.

653
00:38:43,607 --> 00:38:44,808
Let's see then

654
00:38:44,888 --> 00:38:46,248
where you'll find the provisions

655
00:38:46,248 --> 00:38:47,408
to feed these children.

656
00:38:47,408 --> 00:38:49,408
Why do you always go on

657
00:38:49,408 --> 00:38:51,047
about merits and pay?

658
00:38:51,848 --> 00:38:54,007
Have I ever shortchanged you
on food or clothing?

659
00:38:54,687 --> 00:38:56,248
Without that pay, without those merits,

660
00:38:56,248 --> 00:38:56,647
what then?

661
00:38:56,647 --> 00:38:57,728
Would our family starve?

662
00:38:59,047 --> 00:38:59,768
Our eldest

663
00:39:00,448 --> 00:39:01,408
is a girl.

664
00:39:04,248 --> 00:39:05,647
Her prospects

665
00:39:05,808 --> 00:39:07,848
all depend on your rank.

666
00:39:08,728 --> 00:39:09,368
The second one

667
00:39:09,728 --> 00:39:11,007
has just started his schooling.

668
00:39:11,487 --> 00:39:14,888
Who knows if he's cut out for the books?

669
00:39:16,087 --> 00:39:16,647
The third...

670
00:39:18,328 --> 00:39:19,408
The third...

671
00:39:19,607 --> 00:39:21,768
Why are you crying?

672
00:39:23,127 --> 00:39:23,808
Here, wipe your face.

673
00:39:24,007 --> 00:39:24,728
Stop crying.

674
00:39:26,567 --> 00:39:27,888
Stop crying.

675
00:39:27,888 --> 00:39:28,607
Wipe your face.

676
00:39:30,408 --> 00:39:30,808
Come.

677
00:39:33,087 --> 00:39:33,768
So stinky!

678
00:39:36,248 --> 00:39:37,888
Get out there now.

679
00:39:38,368 --> 00:39:39,928
If you don't finish that wine

680
00:39:39,928 --> 00:39:41,127
and get it right today,

681
00:39:41,527 --> 00:39:43,448
you'll see if I don't come after you.

682
00:39:43,567 --> 00:39:44,448
Alright.

683
00:39:44,448 --> 00:39:45,567
Stop crying. Here, come on.

684
00:39:45,567 --> 00:39:46,448
Are you going or not?

685
00:39:47,047 --> 00:39:48,328
If you stop crying, I'll go.

686
00:39:53,647 --> 00:39:54,207
Fine.

687
00:39:55,047 --> 00:39:55,888
I'll drink.

688
00:40:09,808 --> 00:40:10,968
Drinking is forbidden in the army.

689
00:40:10,968 --> 00:40:11,968
I got this for you.

690
00:40:12,127 --> 00:40:13,288
I know you're not feeling good inside.

691
00:40:13,928 --> 00:40:14,487
Have a drink.

692
00:40:15,288 --> 00:40:16,527
Don't tell Zhao Ling.

693
00:40:17,127 --> 00:40:18,328
Who do you think I am?

694
00:40:18,607 --> 00:40:20,448
Lu Dahu was a bully.

695
00:40:20,448 --> 00:40:21,647
He was never a good man.

696
00:40:22,047 --> 00:40:23,328
But the military merits under his name

697
00:40:23,328 --> 00:40:24,368
are valuable.

698
00:40:24,368 --> 00:40:25,848
Thirty-six heads.

699
00:40:26,007 --> 00:40:27,768
Most soldiers serve their whole lives

700
00:40:27,768 --> 00:40:28,728
and never earn that many.

701
00:40:31,768 --> 00:40:32,888
He's dead.

702
00:40:32,888 --> 00:40:33,808
His military registration is void.

703
00:40:33,808 --> 00:40:35,368
But those merits would just go to waste.

704
00:40:35,888 --> 00:40:37,567
But what if we transferred those merits

705
00:40:37,567 --> 00:40:39,207
to your brothers' names?

706
00:40:40,487 --> 00:40:42,487
You are a banner commander
under Commander Zhao.

707
00:40:42,487 --> 00:40:43,288
As long as you claim them,

708
00:40:43,487 --> 00:40:45,288
those merits belong to your brothers.

709
00:40:45,848 --> 00:40:48,248
Commander Zhao
could leap to the fifth rank

710
00:40:48,248 --> 00:40:49,288
and return to the capital in glory.

711
00:40:49,288 --> 00:40:50,928
And you'd get promoted
right along with him.

712
00:40:50,928 --> 00:40:51,487
Nonsense.

713
00:40:52,408 --> 00:40:53,527
That's fraud.

714
00:40:54,687 --> 00:40:56,687
Plenty of people in the army
have done this already.

715
00:40:57,127 --> 00:40:59,408
Once Commander Zhao
is transferred back to the capital,

716
00:40:59,607 --> 00:41:00,647
no one will ever

717
00:41:00,647 --> 00:41:02,127
come looking into this business
in Ganlin Town.

718
00:41:02,127 --> 00:41:02,527
Get lost.

719
00:41:06,196 --> 00:41:07,310
Commander Zhao.

720
00:41:08,636 --> 00:41:13,969
(Noodles)

721
00:41:14,888 --> 00:41:15,768
Banner Commander Yang.

722
00:41:16,968 --> 00:41:17,647
Go on about your business.

723
00:41:22,687 --> 00:41:24,007
How wonderful.

724
00:41:24,127 --> 00:41:25,007
My son

725
00:41:25,127 --> 00:41:27,928
is a proper sixth-rank official now.

726
00:41:28,167 --> 00:41:29,527
Monthly grain supplies,

727
00:41:29,527 --> 00:41:30,968
yearly pay and provisions,

728
00:41:31,248 --> 00:41:33,288
steady and honorable.

729
00:41:33,687 --> 00:41:34,928
It's a pity, though,

730
00:41:34,928 --> 00:41:35,487
I

731
00:41:36,007 --> 00:41:36,968
cannot see

732
00:41:37,408 --> 00:41:39,408
you in your military uniform.

733
00:41:40,127 --> 00:41:40,607
Mother.

734
00:41:42,808 --> 00:41:43,487
Feel it.

735
00:41:43,808 --> 00:41:44,567
Can you feel it?

736
00:41:44,567 --> 00:41:45,408
I can.

737
00:41:45,888 --> 00:41:46,768
When

738
00:41:46,768 --> 00:41:47,687
I meet

739
00:41:47,687 --> 00:41:49,007
your father

740
00:41:49,007 --> 00:41:50,248
in the afterlife,

741
00:41:50,567 --> 00:41:51,368
I'll be able

742
00:41:51,368 --> 00:41:52,808
to hold my head up high.

743
00:41:53,127 --> 00:41:54,167
Darling,

744
00:41:55,087 --> 00:41:56,527
Yucheng

745
00:41:57,007 --> 00:41:58,768
is a general now.

746
00:41:59,007 --> 00:42:01,647
See how well I've raised him.

747
00:42:02,127 --> 00:42:02,607
Mother.

748
00:42:05,567 --> 00:42:06,047
Mother.

749
00:42:07,808 --> 00:42:08,487
I

750
00:42:10,607 --> 00:42:11,368
will work hard

751
00:42:13,487 --> 00:42:14,288
and earn more military merits.

752
00:42:14,607 --> 00:42:15,647
I'll make sure

753
00:42:15,647 --> 00:42:16,768
you have good food at every meal.

754
00:42:17,968 --> 00:42:19,408
When the time comes, just like Mr. Zhao,

755
00:42:19,647 --> 00:42:20,808
I'll get you

756
00:42:20,808 --> 00:42:21,848
a three-courtyard house.

757
00:42:24,567 --> 00:42:26,527
When you earn more merits,

758
00:42:26,888 --> 00:42:28,328
it'll be time for you

759
00:42:28,968 --> 00:42:30,207
to buy me a grave plot.

760
00:42:33,248 --> 00:42:34,687
What are you saying?

761
00:42:35,968 --> 00:42:37,328
You'll live a long, happy life.

762
00:42:38,687 --> 00:42:39,328
Dig in.

763
00:42:40,127 --> 00:42:40,448
Here.

764
00:42:48,687 --> 00:42:49,527
I have come

765
00:42:50,487 --> 00:42:52,007
to apologize.

766
00:42:55,888 --> 00:42:57,047
That day, I offended you

767
00:42:57,288 --> 00:42:58,408
because Lu Dahu

768
00:42:58,408 --> 00:42:59,527
stole our military merits.

769
00:43:00,047 --> 00:43:01,567
I was filled with resentment,

770
00:43:02,087 --> 00:43:03,607
and that's why I talked back.

771
00:43:04,607 --> 00:43:05,408
I hope

772
00:43:07,087 --> 00:43:08,607
you will not hold it against me.

773
00:43:10,248 --> 00:43:11,647
Is what you say true?

774
00:43:12,968 --> 00:43:13,607
Of course.

775
00:43:15,207 --> 00:43:16,968
Those thirty-six Wangur heads

776
00:43:21,127 --> 00:43:22,207
were earned by the brothers

777
00:43:22,647 --> 00:43:24,007
with their very lives.

778
00:43:24,567 --> 00:43:25,368
Lu Dahu

779
00:43:25,368 --> 00:43:26,728
used his rank to crush us.

780
00:43:26,728 --> 00:43:28,007
He took those merits by force.

781
00:43:28,487 --> 00:43:29,167
The soldiers

782
00:43:29,288 --> 00:43:30,808
were all too afraid to speak up.

783
00:43:30,808 --> 00:43:32,487
Now that Lu Dahu is dead,

784
00:43:32,487 --> 00:43:33,808
I beg you to look into this.

785
00:43:33,968 --> 00:43:34,728
I hope

786
00:43:34,968 --> 00:43:36,207
you will return those merits

787
00:43:36,207 --> 00:43:37,408
to the brothers.

788
00:43:37,487 --> 00:43:38,328
I

789
00:43:40,047 --> 00:43:40,888
bow in gratitude.

790
00:43:51,728 --> 00:43:52,328
Mr. Zhao.

791
00:43:53,288 --> 00:43:54,328
What are you doing here?

792
00:43:57,368 --> 00:43:58,087
Yucheng.

793
00:43:58,968 --> 00:44:00,408
Why did you falsify the records?

794
00:44:01,968 --> 00:44:03,207
Why did you claim Lu Dahu's merits

795
00:44:03,567 --> 00:44:04,928
under the brothers' names?

796
00:44:09,408 --> 00:44:11,127
Yucheng, why did you do this?

797
00:44:18,283 --> 00:44:20,716
(Next Episode)

798
00:44:20,888 --> 00:44:22,567
(Official Document)
Commander Zhao has been arrested.

799
00:44:23,007 --> 00:44:24,007
Someone reported him

800
00:44:24,007 --> 00:44:25,207
for killing civilians
and claiming military credit.

801
00:44:25,408 --> 00:44:26,207
That is a crime

802
00:44:26,207 --> 00:44:27,888
punishable by death.

803
00:44:28,087 --> 00:44:29,127
(Yu Jingxiu!)

804
00:44:29,448 --> 00:44:30,527
(To go after me,)

805
00:44:30,728 --> 00:44:31,808
(you disregard the external threat.)

806
00:44:31,808 --> 00:44:33,567
(The Wangur attack on the pass
is a matter of national security.)

807
00:44:34,368 --> 00:44:36,127
(Aren't you afraid of delaying
critical military actions?)

808
00:44:38,408 --> 00:44:39,808
But a major battle is imminent.

809
00:44:40,047 --> 00:44:41,288
If Ganlin falls,

810
00:44:41,848 --> 00:44:44,127
it will descend into chaos instantly.

811
00:44:44,728 --> 00:44:45,768
Come back to the capital with me.

812
00:44:47,328 --> 00:44:48,368
(Shameless.)

813
00:45:02,200 --> 00:45:06,520
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

814
00:45:10,120 --> 00:45:14,480
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

815
00:45:16,600 --> 00:45:21,240
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

816
00:45:21,480 --> 00:45:24,280
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

817
00:45:25,440 --> 00:45:30,080
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

818
00:45:33,280 --> 00:45:40,120
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

819
00:45:41,000 --> 00:45:47,520
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

820
00:45:48,480 --> 00:45:51,920
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

821
00:45:52,440 --> 00:45:56,640
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

822
00:45:56,920 --> 00:46:02,600
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

823
00:46:14,720 --> 00:46:18,600
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

824
00:46:22,520 --> 00:46:26,520
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

825
00:46:28,240 --> 00:46:32,920
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

826
00:46:33,240 --> 00:46:35,920
♪Kept close within my heart♪

827
00:46:37,000 --> 00:46:41,840
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

828
00:46:45,360 --> 00:46:52,280
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

829
00:46:53,160 --> 00:46:59,640
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

830
00:47:00,520 --> 00:47:04,040
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

831
00:47:04,480 --> 00:47:08,840
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

832
00:47:09,040 --> 00:47:14,760
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
